<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Route plan</title>
  <!-- Google Fonts: Hanken Grotesk, Public Sans, IBM Plex Mono -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@600;650&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    /* CSS Reset & Tokens */
    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #F7F7F7;
      color: #202020;
      font-family: 'Public Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* Typography rules */
    h1, h2, h3, .heading-font {
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
    }

    .mono {
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    }

    /* Motion Tokens & Keyframes */
    @keyframes pageEntrance {
      0% {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(6px);
      }
      100% {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes savedHandoff {
      0% {
        opacity: 0.6;
        transform: translateY(8px);
      }
      100% {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes waitingBreathe {
      0%, 100% {
        opacity: 0.7;
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }

    .animate-entrance {
      animation: pageEntrance 260ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
    }

    .animate-handoff {
      animation: savedHandoff 260ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
    }

    .animate-waiting-dot {
      animation: waitingBreathe 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      }
    }

    /* Header */
    header {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      height: 64px;
      padding: 0 32px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .header-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #202020;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      background: #202020;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 650;
      font-size: 14px;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    .brand-name {
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 650;
      font-size: 18px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    nav.header-nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
      height: 64px;
    }

    .nav-link {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #626262;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 500;
      height: 100%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      transition: color 150ms ease;
    }

    .nav-link:hover {
      color: #202020;
    }

    .nav-link:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid #A94B1D;
      outline-offset: -2px;
    }

    .nav-link.active {
      color: #A94B1D;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .nav-link.active::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background-color: #A94B1D;
    }

    .header-right {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .user-profile {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #202020;
    }

    .initials-badge {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      background-color: #F7F7F7;
      border: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      border-radius: 2px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #626262;
    }

    .role-text {
      color: #626262;
    }

    .header-divider {
      width: 1px;
      height: 16px;
      background-color: #D5D5D5;
    }

    .locale-switcher {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #626262;
    }

    /* Layout */
    main {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 32px 64px 32px;
    }

    .page-title {
      font-size: 28px;
      line-height: 1.25;
      font-weight: 650;
      color: #202020;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    /* Panels & Containers */
    .panel {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      border-radius: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    /* Error Alert Panel */
    .error-panel {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #AE2C2C;
      border-radius: 2px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .error-content {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .error-status-badge {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: #AE2C2C;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .error-status-indicator {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background-color: #AE2C2C;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    .error-description {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #626262;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .error-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn {
      height: 48px;
      padding: 0 24px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
      border-radius: 2px;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: background-color 150ms ease, border-color 150ms ease, opacity 150ms ease;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .btn:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid #A94B1D;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background-color: #A94B1D;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #A94B1D;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background-color: #923f17;
      border-color: #923f17;
    }

    .btn-primary:active {
      background-color: #7b3513;
      border-color: #7b3513;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      color: #202020;
      border: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background-color: #F7F7F7;
      border-color: #202020;
    }

    .btn-secondary:active {
      background-color: #EFEFEF;
    }

    /* Summary Bar */
    .summary-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      divide-x: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
    }

    .summary-image-container {
      position: relative;
      width: 200px;
      height: 150px;
      border-right: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #F7F7F7;
    }

    .summary-image-container img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
      border-radius: 2px;
      display: block;
    }

    .summary-col {
      padding: 20px 24px;
      border-right: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .summary-col:last-child {
      border-right: none;
    }

    .col-label {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #626262;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .col-value-title {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 650;
      color: #202020;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .col-meta {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #626262;
    }

    /* Status indicators */
    .status-text {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .status-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .status-good {
      color: #24704B;
    }
    .status-good .status-dot {
      background-color: #24704B;
    }

    .status-waiting {
      color: #805800;
    }
    .status-waiting .status-dot {
      background-color: #805800;
    }

    .status-refused, .status-failed {
      color: #AE2C2C;
    }
    .status-refused .status-dot, .status-failed .status-dot {
      background-color: #AE2C2C;
    }

    /* Section Headers */
    .section-header {
      padding: 16px 24px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 650;
      color: #202020;
    }

    /* Tables */
    .table-container {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      text-align: left;
    }

    th {
      height: 48px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #626262;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    td {
      height: 48px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      font-size: 15px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      color: #202020;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    /* Error Row Highlighting */
    tr.row-error {
      background-color: #FFFDFD;
    }

    tr.row-error td {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
    }

    .error-inline-notice {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #AE2C2C;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* Form Fields */
    .form-panel {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .field-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    label {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #202020;
    }

    input, select, textarea {
      height: 48px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #202020;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
      border-radius: 2px;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 150ms ease;
    }

    input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
      border-color: #A94B1D;
      outline: 2px solid #A94B1D;
      outline-offset: -1px;
    }

    /* Footer Action Area */
    .action-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid #D5D5D5;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="animate-entrance">

  <!-- Header -->
  <header>
    <div class="header-left">
      <a href="#" class="brand">
        <span class="brand-mark">M</span>
        <span class="brand-name">Meridian</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="header-nav">
        <a href="#" class="nav-link">Orders</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-link active">Routes</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="header-right">
      <div class="user-profile">
        <span class="initials-badge">PN</span>
        <span>Priya Nair · <span class="role-text">Dispatcher</span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="header-divider"></div>
      <div class="locale-switcher">EN / العربية</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <main>
    <h1 class="page-title">Route plan</h1>

    <!-- Inline Data Load Error State Panel with Retry Action -->
    <div class="error-panel" role="alert">
      <div class="error-content">
        <div class="error-status-badge">
          <span class="error-status-indicator"></span>
          <span>Failed to load route telemetry and predicted limits</span>
        </div>
        <p class="error-description">
          The service could not synchronize route constraints and configured duration safety margins for schedule <span class="mono">14 May 2026</span>. Stop telemetry, predicted limits, and returned route effects could not be fully resolved.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="error-actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary">Retry</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Route Context Summary Panel -->
    <section class="panel">
      <div class="summary-grid">
        <div class="summary-image-container">
          <!-- Real photographic crop of white van VAN-27, plate MTR-482 -->
          <img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AEtjO1Woh-gVQHYkiPwRK9r_hyHXNLYZ2TpGr6_NCq3dOvDO4NKzf4b4D24JzW72Xx_K1DqxReM5De4KKNZMHXlpB1YvfkiToV_58BGXu2aT4zlcLEuGzee7WkDtM-SKj9gSKj1n1PT47F5X49h4A9XBRr0vWtwsNzPpsdFVQk6ROU3HrAinlL28U6yDu-ebkpyhc1zZUc-TdKe3KRCt5DsiLBq-Xs4wOkCeZO-0W6pOaTGvShhnGkVvvXhggA" alt="White refrigerated delivery van VAN-27 plate MTR-482 parked in logistics bay">
        </div>
        <div class="summary-col">
          <span class="col-label">Route & Vehicle</span>
          <span class="col-value-title">Route <span class="mono">R-204</span></span>
          <span class="col-meta"><span class="mono">VAN-27</span> (Plate <span class="mono">MTR-482</span>)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="summary-col">
          <span class="col-label">Assigned Driver</span>
          <span class="col-value-title">Tariq Mansour</span>
          <span class="col-meta">Scheduled departure <span class="mono">14 May 15:00</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="summary-col">
          <span class="col-label">Route Status</span>
          <div>
            <span class="status-text status-failed">
              <span class="status-dot"></span>
              <span>failed</span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <span class="col-meta" style="margin-top: 4px;">Service sync failed</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Ordered-Stop Editor with Service Limits & Errors -->
    <section class="panel">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Ordered stops</h2>
        <span class="mono" style="font-size: 14px; color: #626262;">1 planned stop</span>
      </div>
      <div class="table-container">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="width: 60px;">Stop</th>
              <th>Destination address</th>
              <th>Planned arrival</th>
              <th>Order & Consignment</th>
              <th>Safety margin</th>
              <th>Predicted limit</th>
              <th>Stop status</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="row-error">
              <td><span class="mono">1</span></td>
              <td>
                <div style="font-weight: 600; color: #202020;">Cedar Clinic</div>
                <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #626262;">42 River Road, London</div>
              </td>
              <td><span class="mono">15:00 BST</span></td>
              <td>
                <div><span class="mono">O-299</span></div>
                <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #626262;"><span class="mono">B-701</span> (12 packs), <span class="mono">B-702</span> (8 packs)</div>
              </td>
              <td>
                <span class="mono">30 min</span>
                <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #626262;">Profile v3 (>8–10°C)</div>
              </td>
              <td>
                <span class="mono">45 min max</span>
                <div class="error-inline-notice" style="margin-top: 2px;">
                  <span>Exceeds safety margin</span>
                </div>
              </td>
              <td>
                <span class="status-text status-failed">
                  <span class="status-dot"></span>
                  <span>failed</span>
                </span>
                <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #AE2C2C; margin-top: 2px;">Data failed to load</div>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Service-Returned Changes & Duration Safety Limits Panel -->
    <section class="panel">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Service-returned changes to route</h2>
        <span class="status-text status-failed">
          <span class="status-dot"></span>
          <span>failed</span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 24px;">
        <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #626262; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          The route editor does not silently accept manual timing edits. Instead, returned changes from the route verification service are reported directly alongside safety margins:
        </p>
        <div style="background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px solid #D5D5D5; border-radius: 2px; padding: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: #202020; line-height: 1.6;">
          <div style="font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #AE2C2C;">Service validation error returned:</div>
          <div>Unable to verify qualified-duration safety margin for <span class="mono">VAN-27</span> route schedule to <span class="mono">Cedar Clinic, 42 River Road</span>. Service returned connection timeout during prediction evaluation. Review stop sequence and retry route confirmation.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Page Actions -->
    <div class="action-bar">
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">Route detail</a>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Confirm route</button>
    </div>

  </main>

</body>
</html>
